Package: fsbrainFmriVisWorkflows
Type: Project
Title: fsbrain fMRI Visualization Workflows
Description: R apps demonstrating fMRI visualization workflows using fsbrain.
    Two validated workflows: volumetric MNI152 to fsaverage (regfusionr) and
    CIFTI grayordinates to fs_LR 32k (freesurferformats).
